<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20972" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρίζω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβριξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					826
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.):—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρισθείς: ὑπνώσας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—poet. Verb, <i>to be sleepy, nod</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἂν βρίζοντα ἴδοις Ἀγαμέμνονα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.223
				</span></i>
			; <i>slumber</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρίζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					897
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαν . . βριζούσης φρενός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					275
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of guilt, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρίζει γὰρ αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					280
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρίζει: ἐσθίει, πιέζει, κύει</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
